  "contentHtml": "<p>구글 검색이 AI와 연동되면 좋겠다는 생각을 하고 있었는데요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#39;AI 모드&#39; 아이콘이 생겼어요!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>구글을 기반으로 AI 도구를 활용할 수 있게 되었어요.</p><p>무료입니다~</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1fcec0a9d318e099d9f40db4abbf83c245a11005\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1fcec0a9d318e099d9f40db4abbf83c245a11005\" data-origin-width=\"751\" data-origin-height=\"281\"></div><p>그리고</p><p>화면의 좌측 상단의</p><p>시계 아이콘을 클릭하시면,</p><p>대화 내용 목록을 보실 수 있습니다~&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/da5ccb70aeb56236cde756cac680a4f2c1ed1c28\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/da5ccb70aeb56236cde756cac680a4f2c1ed1c28\" data-origin-width=\"76\" data-origin-height=\"225\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>접속은</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.google.com/</a></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
